Complete the comprehensive abstract class example:

```dart
abstract class %order% {
  String name;
  int health;
  int mana;

  // Constructor
  GameCharacter(this.name, this.health, this.mana);

  // Abstract methods - must be implemented
  void %order%();
  void %order%();
  String get %order%();

  // Concrete methods - shared implementation
  void displayStats() {
    print('$name - Health: $health, Mana: $mana');
  }

  // Final method - cannot be overridden
  %order% void levelUp() {
    health += 10;
    mana += 5;
    print('$name leveled up! 🎉');
  }

  // Private helper method
  void _regenerate() {
    if (health < 100) health += 2;
    if (mana < 50) mana += 1;
  }

  // Template method
  final void performAction() {
    _regenerate();
    displayStats();
    attack();
    performSpecialMove();
  }
}
```

What is the main benefit of abstract classes?

